.TH QIMGVR 1 "2026-10-20" "de-xr" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
qimgvr \- view images and send stereoscopic output to XR
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
qimgvr [OPTIONS] [PATH]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Qt6 image viewer with optional mpv video playback and Arc SBS depth conversion. Ordinary image and video viewing does not require the inference runtime. Automatic 2D\-to\-SBS conversion of still images runs in a separate worker.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B "\-\-sbs"
Enable SBS output, including local preview without XR.
.TP
.B "\-\-no\-sbs"
Disable SBS output.
.TP
.B "\-\-domed"
Select DomeD output.
.TP
.B "\-\-input\-layout auto|2d|full\-sbs|half\-sbs"
Override input stereo layout detection.
.TP
.B "\-\-build\-options"
Print compiled features and detected image formats.
.TP
.B "\-\-gen\-thumbs DIRECTORY"
Generate thumbnails for a directory.
.TP
.B "\-\-gen\-thumbs\-size SIZE"
Select thumbnail size for generation.
.TP
.B "\-\-help"
Show usage.
.SH KEYS
F8 toggles SBS/XR output. F9 changes the input stereo layout override.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
QIMGV_SBS_PYTHON selects the Python interpreter containing arc_sbs and its dependencies. An isolated system deployment may use /usr/local/libexec/arc\-sbs/venv/bin/python. The worker also requires the separately prepared model and GPU drivers.
.SH FILES
Existing viewer settings remain under ~/.config/qimgv. qimgvr uses its own thumbnail cache.
.SH SEE ALSO
arc\-sbs(1), mpvr(1), dome\-compositor(1)
